sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Fu et al. (2005) ROP2-ROP6 interdigitated puzzle-shaped pavement cell lobing and Largest Empty Circle (LEC) turgor stress scaling faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana (cotyledon & leaf epidermal pavement cells) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Arabidopsis thaliana (cotyledon & leaf epidermal pavement cells) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-pavement-cell-lobing-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py; output: docs/media/pavement_cell_lobing_comparison.png; organism: Arabidopsis thaliana (cotyledon & leaf epidermal pavement cells); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 972460a5749d7d30868f5de9c61bcfd278fa143f89d629090a75b7aa4ebdc287; artifact_sha256: 8df82fae6327068a70bf77aefe4e8d85e05dc9e0d53c002655ab4d6165803e01; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/arabidopsis_pavement_cell_specimen.jpg=4b7c1062f6ebfd6e..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/paper_citations.bib=e5d0ea8ec26365c9..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/pavement_cell_lobing_reference.json=de4e6daab5eae4a0..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/scout_manifest.json=72c917ec10ac1a55...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-pavement-cell-lobing-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Sapala et al. (2018) eLife 7:e32794 outer periclinal cell wall tensile stress scaling with Largest Empty Circle radius (sigma_max ~ P * R_LEC / h), demonstrating that interdigitated puzzle lobing pins R_LEC near ~11.4 um as cell area expands to 4500 um^2 whereas isotropic polygonal/mutant cells grow as sqrt(A/pi) | Fu et al. (2005) Cell 120:687-700 & Lin et al. (2013) Curr Biol 23:290-297 antagonistic cortical ROP2-RIC4 (actin lobe outgrowth) and ROP6-RIC1-KTN1 (katanin-mediated microtubule neck bundling) polarization in antiphase across shared anticlinal cell walls, and lobeyness collapse in rop2 rop4 RNAi and ktn1/ric1 mutants; reconstructed_in_script: Exact 2D Euclidean Distance Transform Largest Empty Circle (R_LEC) and ConvexHull solidity/lobeyness solver across cell area growth A in [250, 4500] um^2 for wild-type Col-0 puzzle cells, unlobed isotropic cells, ktn1/ric1 and rop2 rop4 mutants, and parallel-file monocot epidermis | 196-node periodic anticlinal boundary coupled ROP2-RIC4 / ROP6-RIC1-KTN1 reaction-diffusion PDE integrator reproducing intracortical mutual exclusion (r = -0.9899), trans-wall lobe-neck complementarity (r = 0.9998), 24.5 um lobe wavelength, and exact intercellular area conservation | Automated DoG + zero-compactness watershed segmentation of 10 interlocking puzzle-shaped pavement cells from the SHA-256-locked Arabidopsis thaliana leaf epidermis SEM micrograph (`arabidopsis_pavement_cell_specimen.jpg`, mean S = 0.720, min S = 0.626, mean L = 1.506); transfer_boundary: 2D anticlinal boundary PDE and spring-remodeled polygonal contours with Euclidean Distance Transform R_LEC mapped to 2D epidermal SEM projections; does_not_claim: Full 3D finite-element shell modeling of dome deflection z(x,y) coupled to discrete microtubule filament polymerization stochastics]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
            <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
            <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.93"^^xsd:double .

